        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its round body makes it easy to pick up, but it is hard and heavy. It’s dangerous to play with them as if they were snowballs.",
